solve isn't clear then now I'm going to be lost in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.520
the sauce of the rest of your screenplay because&nbsp;
I don't know what I'm tracking so kind of like an&nbsp;&nbsp;

