prove to you and then all of the the following&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.620
paragraphs have the evidence of the thing that&nbsp;
you hypothesized or the thing that you're trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:45.720
to prove so now I can read it and go okay this&nbsp;
connects back to that this connects back to that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:50.100
because I know what I'm tracking the same thing is&nbsp;
true in a screenplay if you haven't given me that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:54.600
inciting incident and that goal or that problem&nbsp;
then I don't have a thesis statement so I don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

