be tracking if I don't know if this is even if&nbsp;
if their story should even be taking them down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:11.460
that path because you didn't make it very clear&nbsp;
for me what they were seeking in the first place&nbsp;&nbsp;

